# Thermal 1: Conduction

Heat flows through bodies and across their surfaces. This chapter models it as a network of nodes and conductances, solves the steady state, follows the temperatures through time, and gives the resistances, fins and meshes that supply the network's numbers.

- [Networks and steady state](thermal_01_conduction/networks_and_steady_state.md)
- [Transient response](thermal_01_conduction/transient_response.md)
- [Walls, fins and meshes](thermal_01_conduction/walls_and_fins.md)
